[PrintTextModified Text:"（只不过奈叶香之前一定是在地下……！<br>　地下肯定发生了什么事……！）|#0105Trial03_Ema003|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR3,ArmL2,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Normal_Closed02,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Determined_Closed,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
[PrintTextModified Text:"（现在，哪怕是一丁点破绽或线索……<br>　什么都行！）|#0105Trial03_Ema004|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

