# Judge5-3-17

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-First
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:false
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-Last

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR3,ArmL2,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Angry_Open04,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Confused_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:真的不能从地下一侧进入处刑台吗……？<br>应该有人能进去的吧，<br>比如典狱长或者管理员……！|#0105Trial03_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; SE・気になる音

@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_Common_1 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Position:,{characterPositionY} Duration:0 Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Left
[PrintTextModified Text:那么，这一点就由我来解释吧。|#0105Trial03_Warden001| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR3,ArmL2,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:典狱长……！|#0105Trial03_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Left
[PrintTextModified Text:处刑台装置的作用就是为了保障安全，<br>将受刑的魔女隔离至地下<br>防止其逃脱。|#0105Trial03_Warden002| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Left
[PrintTextModified Text:而要在处刑台和地下之间往来，<br>就需要打开地下的门。|#0105Trial03_Warden003| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Left
[PrintTextModified Text:但是，除了【经审判的处刑执行】时，<br>要打开那扇门需要各种批准……|#0105Trial03_Warden004| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Left
[PrintTextModified Text:所以这扇门连我也没法随便打开，<br>就更别说在岛上的各位了。|#0105Trial03_Warden005| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Left
[PrintTextModified Text:即便得到了批准打开了门，<br>那时整个监牢都会<br>产生【巨大的震动】。|#0105Trial03_Warden006| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Left
[PrintTextModified Text:就算通过某种手段把门打开了，<br>也总会有人注意到震动……<br>况且，这次连开门的【记录】都没留下。|#0105Trial03_Warden007| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Left
[PrintTextModified Text:地下的门最后一次打开<br>是在橘雪莉小姐被处刑的时候……|#0105Trial03_Warden008| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Left
[PrintTextModified Text:之后就再也没有打开过了，<br>这一点我可以保证。|#0105Trial03_Warden009| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Ema.Default,ArmR4,ArmL5,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Pensive_Open02,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Cry_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Ema Composition:Center
[PrintTextModified Text:"（那扇【门】没有被打开……<br>　那么奈叶香真的没有经地下前去处刑台……？）|#0105Trial03_Ema008|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR1,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:……虽然你说这扇门没记录……|#0105Trial03_Coco006| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR3,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right
[PrintTextModified Text:那其他的门呢？<br>在路上的那扇门，有没有留下开启记录？|#0105Trial03_Coco007| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Left
[PrintTextModified Text:这个嘛，只有【地下的门】和【处刑台的升降】<br>会留下记录。|#0105Trial03_Warden010| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR3,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Closed,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Gross_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right
